ddressCountry":"US"},"description":"Before founding Lockwood Private Wealth, I advised clients at J.P. Morgan Private Bank, Merrill Lynch Wealth Management, and a billion-dollar independent wealth management firm. Those experiences reinforced a lesson I carry with me today: the greatest value an advisor provides is not simply managing investments, but helping clients make better decisions about their wealth.

